id: pm-ts-starter-native-refusal-codes
title: Preserve native refusal codes in legacy starter demo errors
description: The legacy pmExpectedError helper stores context.code but does not mirror it to error.code. Current CLI native error rendering falls back to command_failed for these demo errors. The new schema rehearsal command uses the SDK createPmCliExpectedError factory and is unaffected. Replace or delegate legacy construction to the SDK factory in a focused follow-up.
